EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC
CONSTANTS NULL
CONSTANTS GENESIS_HASH, all_stations, chain, gazette_anchors, selected
\* TODO: bind `Hash` to the implementation's own definition.
\* Left unconstrained here, so the invariants below type-check
\* without proving anything about it.
Hash(a0) == CHOOSE r : TRUE
VARIABLES state
Inv1 == \A i_1 \in 1..Len(chain)-1 : chain[i_1+1].prev_hash = Hash(chain[i_1])
Inv2 == Len(chain) >= 1 => chain[1].prev_hash = GENESIS_HASH
Inv3 == \A i_3, j_3 \in 1..Len(chain) : i_3 /= j_3 => chain[i_3].audit_id /= chain[j_3].audit_id
Inv4 == \A entry_4 \in {chain[i_4] : i_4 \in DOMAIN chain} : Cardinality(entry_4.signatures) >= 2
Inv5 == 100 * Len(selected) >= 4 * Len(all_stations) /\ 100 * Len(selected) <= 6 * Len(all_stations)
Inv6 == \A g_6 \in gazette_anchors : g_6.sha256 = Hash(g_6.content)

